comparisons with another person? Those collapse too.

10
00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:40,480
المقارنات لازمة غير ملزمة، بمعنى: أقارن نفسي
Comparisons are useful, not binding — meaning I compare myself

11
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:47,560
